WEBVTT

00:01:36.310 --> 00:01:40.240
The search for the final Darkstar
weapon has been a long one, hasn't it?

00:01:40.310 --> 00:01:42.970
And who should be waiting for
us at the temple in the ice?

00:01:43.050 --> 00:01:45.740
Whoa! The Supreme Elder
of the Dragon race!

00:01:45.820 --> 00:01:47.750
Hey, if you knew where
this place was...

00:01:47.820 --> 00:01:49.610
...why didn't you just
tell us to start with?!

00:01:50.090 --> 00:01:51.950
Here we found the
secret history of...

00:01:52.020 --> 00:01:54.490
...the Ancient Dragons
and the golden dragons.

00:01:54.560 --> 00:01:58.080
Hey! That was a really
cheap shot, Xellos!

00:02:20.380 --> 00:02:22.680
- Amelia, do it.
- Right...

00:02:23.050 --> 00:02:24.380
LYBRIEM!

00:02:39.570 --> 00:02:43.900
This is the only burial
we can give them now.

00:02:43.970 --> 00:02:46.770
Rest in peace, all of you.

00:02:59.020 --> 00:03:00.350
Almayce...

00:03:00.420 --> 00:03:02.320
He was one of them.

00:03:02.390 --> 00:03:05.790
To do that to someone
from their own world!

00:03:05.860 --> 00:03:08.300
He must have disagreed
with their plans.

00:03:08.600 --> 00:03:10.760
Almayce didn't
want to do anything...

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:13.360
...to needlessly
harm this world.

00:03:13.940 --> 00:03:17.340
While Erulogos will do anything
to accomplish his goal.

00:03:17.440 --> 00:03:21.770
He doesn't care about this world
so long as his world is saved.

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:31.110
Please forgive me...

00:03:31.190 --> 00:03:34.620
I'm not fit to even speak to you.

00:03:45.770 --> 00:03:48.430
I will never, ever forget you.

00:03:54.010 --> 00:03:55.410
Filia.

00:03:56.350 --> 00:03:59.440
We have no time for grief.

00:03:59.780 --> 00:04:03.780
They may be summoning
Darkstar as we speak...

00:04:04.020 --> 00:04:06.960
...with our world facing
imminent destruction.

00:04:07.820 --> 00:04:10.660
I wouldn't be trying to
give orders here, Old Man!

00:04:10.790 --> 00:04:14.730
We know! We know
what you tried here.

00:04:14.830 --> 00:04:16.960
You were using the army
of the golden dragons...

00:04:17.030 --> 00:04:19.330
...to cover everything up!

00:04:19.940 --> 00:04:22.370
You tried to kill us,
the Overworlders...

00:04:22.440 --> 00:04:25.430
Even sacrifice Filia!
Am I wrong?!

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:38.880
From this day on, I will
never return to the temple.

00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:40.650
I will no longer serve as a priestess!

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:43.560
As you wish.

00:04:44.960 --> 00:04:46.160
All right, in that case...

00:04:46.700 --> 00:04:48.890
Let's get geared up
and on our way!

00:04:49.070 --> 00:04:49.830
Yeah!

00:04:50.070 --> 00:04:50.860
Right!

00:04:54.270 --> 00:04:56.760
Foolish humans...

00:04:58.680 --> 00:05:00.110
Miss Lina, go where, exactly?

00:05:00.180 --> 00:05:01.640
Do you even need to ask?

00:05:02.410 --> 00:05:04.440
To the center of the world!

00:05:28.840 --> 00:05:32.300
There we go...
We've finally made it here.

00:05:37.410 --> 00:05:39.610
Ah, calling to your
comrades, is that it?

00:05:40.120 --> 00:05:43.750
Then let's get Galvayra seated
with the others at once.

00:05:47.920 --> 00:05:50.150
Struggling won't
do you any good.

00:05:50.230 --> 00:05:52.990
Like it or not, you're
going back to your world.

00:06:00.740 --> 00:06:03.870
I just said that
struggling won't do any good.

00:06:04.340 --> 00:06:06.740
Isn't that right,
Erulogos and Sirius?

00:06:12.550 --> 00:06:14.640
You intend to
close the gateway?

00:06:15.190 --> 00:06:18.280
Oh, dear...
I was so close, too.

00:06:18.350 --> 00:06:20.290
I do have some needs
of my own, you know.

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:21.960
Don't play with us!

00:06:22.030 --> 00:06:27.220
What needs does a Monster have
besides to destroy the world?

00:06:27.560 --> 00:06:29.620
My needs as a Monster.

00:06:29.700 --> 00:06:33.230
If this world is to be destroyed,
we'll be the ones to do it.

00:06:33.470 --> 00:06:38.200
We can't very well allow
Darkstar to destroy it for us.

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:39.740
What did you say?!

00:06:40.110 --> 00:06:42.910
That's why I'm getting rid of Darkstar.

00:06:43.280 --> 00:06:46.040
After that, I'll be sure
to destroy the gateway...

00:06:46.120 --> 00:06:49.140
...to insure he never returns,
so don't worry about that.

00:06:49.220 --> 00:06:50.810
Strange though.

00:06:50.890 --> 00:06:54.850
Monsters aren't really supposed
to save the world, are we?

00:07:09.710 --> 00:07:12.000
Don't be rash, Erulogos!

00:07:12.080 --> 00:07:15.980
Silence! Xellos, from this
moment on, you are our enemy!

00:07:16.210 --> 00:07:20.950
Oh, dear. Did you really think
I was your ally up till now?

00:07:21.320 --> 00:07:22.410
Enough!

00:07:25.290 --> 00:07:27.720
Oh, how terribly rude.

00:07:49.380 --> 00:07:52.510
Good grief.
I wouldn't fight here.

00:07:52.580 --> 00:07:54.680
What if the gateway
were to be damaged?

00:08:30.890 --> 00:08:33.980
Perfect!
With this orihalcon armor...

00:08:34.060 --> 00:08:36.420
...it'll stand up to
even their firepower!

00:08:43.870 --> 00:08:46.390
The path of vengeance
is a painful one.

00:08:46.570 --> 00:08:48.090
But soon I'll be done.

00:08:48.170 --> 00:08:51.000
This ultimate weapon
will soon be complete!

00:08:51.410 --> 00:08:55.400
Boss... Lord Valgaav...
For you, I'll keep trying!

00:08:55.480 --> 00:08:57.780
C'mon!
Walk faster! Faster!

00:08:57.850 --> 00:08:59.280
Will walking "briskly" do?

00:08:59.350 --> 00:09:00.250
What?

00:09:00.620 --> 00:09:01.670
Those voices!

00:09:03.190 --> 00:09:05.090
This place is
really falling apart.

00:09:05.150 --> 00:09:07.450
But where have
I seen it before?

00:09:07.520 --> 00:09:10.520
You idiot! This is
Valgaav's hideout!

00:09:10.960 --> 00:09:14.490
You haven't just seen it before.
You've been here before!

00:09:17.200 --> 00:09:19.630
It's them!

00:09:20.570 --> 00:09:24.170
But, Miss Lina, I know we came
here to get to the Pillar of Light...

00:09:24.640 --> 00:09:27.110
...but last time we came,
we couldn't figure out...

00:09:27.180 --> 00:09:28.800
...how to make the system work.

00:09:29.110 --> 00:09:30.940
It's our only chance.

00:09:31.010 --> 00:09:33.980
Who knows how many days
it would take to fly there.

00:09:34.380 --> 00:09:37.840
Quit talking! Let's get
to the control room fast!

00:09:43.190 --> 00:09:44.450
Filia...

00:09:52.840 --> 00:09:54.030
Valgaav...

00:09:55.370 --> 00:09:57.670
Miss Filia looks so sad.

00:09:57.740 --> 00:09:59.230
Can you blame her?

00:09:59.310 --> 00:10:02.070
Learning the truth must
have really rattled her.

00:10:02.150 --> 00:10:04.770
A rattler?
You see snakes in here?

00:10:04.850 --> 00:10:05.810
Bad joke!

00:10:09.320 --> 00:10:13.150
Valgaav...
Are you still alive?

00:10:14.990 --> 00:10:16.360
That hurt!

00:10:16.430 --> 00:10:19.690
C'mon! We've got lots
of work to do! Lots!

00:10:19.900 --> 00:10:21.090
Hey, hold it!

00:10:21.160 --> 00:10:23.860
We don't have time for
you to be so hesitant. Jeez!

00:10:24.100 --> 00:10:26.860
I'm not being hesitant!
I was just...

00:10:27.240 --> 00:10:30.000
Look, girls are supposed
to be cheerful!

00:10:30.070 --> 00:10:32.370
They're not supposed to let
the past get them down!

00:10:32.440 --> 00:10:35.280
When it's time to do
something, they just do it!

00:10:42.750 --> 00:10:44.480
What the?!

00:10:48.420 --> 00:10:52.090
It's a weapon I built specially
for sending you all to hell!

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:54.730
AGH! JILLAS!

00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:57.930
You red foxes should
know when to quit!

00:10:58.300 --> 00:11:00.460
You all waltzing in here...

00:11:00.540 --> 00:11:03.840
...when I still have to avenge
the boss is really lucky for me!

00:11:03.910 --> 00:11:05.770
Now I can join Lord Valgaav!

00:11:06.180 --> 00:11:09.010
Mr. Jillas!
You have it all wrong!

00:11:09.080 --> 00:11:11.740
Oh, heck, I can spare some
time to fight this loser.

00:11:12.320 --> 00:11:13.610
FIREBALL!

00:11:14.820 --> 00:11:17.150
Huh?! No way! What happened?
Why didn't it?!

00:11:17.420 --> 00:11:21.520
You see? This tank's
armored with orihalcon!

00:11:21.590 --> 00:11:24.490
Your magic won't
work against it at all!

00:11:26.960 --> 00:11:30.920
Serves you right!
Go ahead and try fighting me!

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:34.440
Stupid sorceress!
No talent hack magician!

00:11:34.500 --> 00:11:36.400
Nyah-nyah-nya-NYAH-nyaaaa!

00:11:37.040 --> 00:11:40.240
Dammit! I'm not gonna take
that from stupid JILLAS!

00:11:46.380 --> 00:11:48.940
This one's for the boss!
FIRE!

00:12:12.010 --> 00:12:15.040
Is... Is everyone all right?

00:12:15.420 --> 00:12:16.940
That guy's starting to impress me.

00:12:17.020 --> 00:12:18.980
What do we do, Lina?

00:12:20.720 --> 00:12:24.250
"Darkness beyond twilight,
crimson beyond blood that flows!"

00:12:25.690 --> 00:12:27.460
Miss Lina, what are you thinking?!

00:12:28.090 --> 00:12:30.460
If you fire a Dragon
Slave in here...

00:12:30.530 --> 00:12:33.400
...you'll destroy that
magical transporter machine!

00:12:33.470 --> 00:12:35.200
Dammit, let me go!

00:12:35.270 --> 00:12:37.790
This is the only way
I'm gonna calm down now!

00:12:37.870 --> 00:12:39.860
Now I'm really pissed off!

00:12:42.080 --> 00:12:44.440
At last, I'll finally have my revenge!

00:12:44.510 --> 00:12:47.410
Watch this, Boss! Lord Valgaav!

00:12:49.280 --> 00:12:52.410
If magic can't work against it,
then that's our cue!

00:12:53.590 --> 00:12:55.920
ByJillas!
By freaking JILLAS!

00:12:56.220 --> 00:12:58.320
He's just got that
one big cannon...

00:12:58.390 --> 00:13:00.380
...but he can't move
as fast as we can!

00:13:01.590 --> 00:13:02.690
Idiot!

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:04.790
You guys are the idiots!

00:13:13.010 --> 00:13:16.310
Oh! Mr. Zelgadis!
Mr. Gourry!

00:13:16.510 --> 00:13:18.840
Oh, that was your "cue," huh?!

00:13:25.890 --> 00:13:26.940
A BOMB?!

00:13:27.020 --> 00:13:28.510
Is he going
to self-destruct?!

00:13:28.920 --> 00:13:30.950
Agh! No way!

00:13:31.320 --> 00:13:32.920
I'll take you with me!

00:13:32.990 --> 00:13:37.020
As long as I avenge the boss,
I don't need to live!

00:13:37.400 --> 00:13:42.600
Jillas! Listen, we don't need the
situation to get more complicated!

00:13:42.670 --> 00:13:46.330
That's right! You're going to
get yourself killed, Mr. Jillas!

00:13:46.910 --> 00:13:48.670
That's beside the point!

00:13:48.740 --> 00:13:52.300
I'll have my vengeance on
everyone! That's my job!

00:13:52.380 --> 00:13:54.240
I don't care what
happens after that!

00:13:54.680 --> 00:13:56.580
You don't care?!

00:13:57.680 --> 00:13:58.810
Miss Filia!

00:13:58.890 --> 00:14:01.180
Filia, don't be stupid!

00:14:06.130 --> 00:14:08.650
Wh- What do you want?!

00:14:08.960 --> 00:14:11.930
I'm sick of vengeance!
Stop this foolishness now!

00:14:12.000 --> 00:14:14.760
Nobody wants you to do this!

00:14:14.930 --> 00:14:19.670
What?! How could you know
how Lord Valgaav felt?!

00:14:20.610 --> 00:14:22.670
Now outta my way, dammit!

00:14:23.110 --> 00:14:23.940
What are you?!

00:14:26.350 --> 00:14:29.980
Valgaav hated the golden dragons.

00:14:30.320 --> 00:14:32.610
There was no one in the
world he hated more.

00:14:32.750 --> 00:14:34.220
Wh- What are you talkin' about?!

00:14:34.550 --> 00:14:38.680
That hatred... As a golden
dragon, I accept all of it.

00:14:38.760 --> 00:14:40.620
Just please let Miss Lina
and the others go!

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:42.080
Miss Filia...

00:14:42.160 --> 00:14:45.860
Filia... That girl's just
talking crazy now!

00:14:46.500 --> 00:14:49.800
It's to save
the world. Please!

00:14:50.170 --> 00:14:52.140
Y- You...

00:14:54.210 --> 00:14:56.400
I hit the self-destruct button!

00:14:56.740 --> 00:14:57.570
You what?!

00:14:57.910 --> 00:15:01.310
Filia! Never mind!
Run! Just run for it!

00:15:02.450 --> 00:15:04.750
I really don't want to die!

00:15:06.050 --> 00:15:06.950
Oh, my...

00:15:07.320 --> 00:15:08.980
Filia!

00:15:16.800 --> 00:15:19.790
It's pretty!
But why did this happen?

00:15:19.870 --> 00:15:22.770
Because the little idiot stuffed
his self-destruction bomb...

00:15:22.840 --> 00:15:24.960
...with fireworks instead
of regular gunpowder.

00:15:25.040 --> 00:15:26.700
Stupid little troublemaker!

00:15:41.620 --> 00:15:42.550
Miss Lina.

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:45.250
What did you mean,
"I accept all his hatred?!"

00:15:45.320 --> 00:15:46.950
I'll say this:
I hate heroines...

00:15:47.030 --> 00:15:49.720
...who go for that big,
sad martyr stuff!

00:15:52.570 --> 00:15:57.400
Besides, you have a responsibility
to keep going to the very end.

00:15:57.470 --> 00:16:01.500
'Cuz you belong in
this world. Got that?

00:16:01.570 --> 00:16:03.200
Miss Lina...

00:16:03.910 --> 00:16:09.010
Anyway, Jillas, you really had
some fun with me, didn't you?

00:16:09.220 --> 00:16:12.950
What was it you said? " Stupid
sorceress?!" " Hack magician?!"

00:16:13.020 --> 00:16:17.750
For all the trouble
you've caused me...

00:16:17.820 --> 00:16:20.880
...I should kick your ass,
you little creep!

00:16:22.430 --> 00:16:25.860
Now then, how shall
I exact my punishment?

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:30.900
Miss Lina, I really
hate that kind of laugh!

00:16:31.570 --> 00:16:34.100
Anyway, let's check on
Mr. Zelgadis and Mr. Gourry!

00:16:34.170 --> 00:16:35.870
Oh, yeah! That's right!

00:16:39.210 --> 00:16:41.310
Mr. Jillas, try to cheer up.

00:16:41.380 --> 00:16:42.780
Y- You...

00:16:43.320 --> 00:16:47.450
Your breasts are
so big. And soft, too.

00:16:49.090 --> 00:16:50.060
Forget about them!

00:16:50.120 --> 00:16:51.210
Right...

00:16:53.930 --> 00:16:57.490
I think he did this, and then...

00:16:59.770 --> 00:17:03.260
Dammit, I thought that was
the control switch, too!

00:17:03.500 --> 00:17:05.870
Um, may I help?

00:17:05.940 --> 00:17:08.840
It's all right!
I owe you my life.

00:17:08.910 --> 00:17:10.710
It's my duty to help
someone who saved me.

00:17:11.380 --> 00:17:15.340
You get the idea Mr. Jillas is
getting attached to Miss Filia now?

00:17:15.410 --> 00:17:17.510
Who cares?
He's not bothering us now.

00:17:21.120 --> 00:17:24.280
Got it! This will take
us to the Pillar of Light!

00:17:26.060 --> 00:17:27.750
You don't have to come.

00:17:27.830 --> 00:17:30.490
I will protect my savior!
That's common sense.

00:17:30.560 --> 00:17:31.430
Right, Boss?

00:17:31.860 --> 00:17:33.390
B- Boss?!

00:17:33.870 --> 00:17:35.490
Sure, whatever.

00:17:35.570 --> 00:17:38.400
Okay, everyone's together,
so let's go!

00:18:04.430 --> 00:18:05.560
Thank you, Filia!

00:18:06.000 --> 00:18:09.090
Mr. Jillas, did you set
those controls right?!

00:18:09.170 --> 00:18:11.230
I- It's not my fault!

00:18:12.000 --> 00:18:15.740
We're close! We just have
to fly through the storm!

00:18:16.480 --> 00:18:19.240
Um... I suppose
I can do that, but...

00:18:19.310 --> 00:18:21.910
Hey, don't sweat the details!

00:18:36.000 --> 00:18:37.720
Oh, how sad. You missed.

00:18:52.310 --> 00:18:57.310
Oh, my. It's so hard to control
the power on this thing.

00:18:57.520 --> 00:19:00.310
But we'll be settling
things very soon, I imagine.

00:19:04.420 --> 00:19:05.860
Sirius!

00:19:05.930 --> 00:19:09.690
Oh, my. Are you going
to oppose me as well?

00:19:10.360 --> 00:19:12.230
I just want
to ask one thing.

00:19:12.300 --> 00:19:15.760
Are you saying even you Monsters
want to protect this world?

00:19:15.840 --> 00:19:19.030
Well, in this case you could
say we're protecting it...

00:19:19.110 --> 00:19:22.230
...so that we can
destroy it ourselves.

00:19:22.310 --> 00:19:25.370
I never thought I'd see the
day when a God and a Monster...

00:19:25.440 --> 00:19:28.110
...would lay their differences
aside and join forces.

00:19:28.380 --> 00:19:29.710
Sirius!

00:19:29.950 --> 00:19:33.750
You got Galvayra away
from us brilliantly.

00:19:33.820 --> 00:19:36.050
I must salute you
and your superiors.

00:19:36.120 --> 00:19:37.350
I appreciate it.

00:19:37.890 --> 00:19:39.380
Look at the gateway.

00:19:39.460 --> 00:19:42.090
It's already taken
too much damage.

00:19:42.160 --> 00:19:45.030
If we activate it again,
we won't be able to close it.

00:19:45.500 --> 00:19:48.700
Therefore, we have only
one option left.

00:19:48.770 --> 00:19:50.460
If both worlds are to be saved...

00:19:54.870 --> 00:19:56.170
...then Darkstar must die!

00:19:59.750 --> 00:20:04.240
Impossible! We can't defeat
Darkstar by ourselves!

00:20:04.680 --> 00:20:06.170
By ourselves, no...

00:20:12.860 --> 00:20:16.990
Well, can I assume our
differences have been worked out?

00:20:17.760 --> 00:20:20.060
Because it looks like it's
time for our debate to end.

00:20:22.970 --> 00:20:26.130
Almost there! Hi-ho, Filia!

00:20:26.210 --> 00:20:27.900
What am I, a horse?

00:20:28.140 --> 00:20:31.340
Hang in there, Boss!

00:20:31.610 --> 00:20:33.640
And would you please
stop calling me boss?!

00:20:34.150 --> 00:20:36.170
C'mon, Miss Filia! C'mon!

00:20:36.480 --> 00:20:38.350
Now cut that out!

00:20:42.090 --> 00:20:43.390
Miss Lina!

00:20:43.790 --> 00:20:45.150
Oh, no...

00:20:46.790 --> 00:20:49.960
We're too late!
Right before our eyes...

00:20:50.030 --> 00:20:53.620
...the gates of hell are opening
and Darkstar's coming through!

00:20:53.900 --> 00:20:57.670
No... Is the world really going
to be destroyed by darkness?!

00:22:21.790 --> 00:22:24.350
MOVE YOUR BUTT, FILIA!

00:22:24.420 --> 00:22:27.520
It's time for the
final showdown!

00:22:27.590 --> 00:22:30.760
Next time, " No Way to Guess!
The Forbidden Gateway is Opened!"

00:22:30.830 --> 00:22:33.590
You'd better watch, or I'll
REALLY cause some trouble!
